ug": "hidden-squirrels", "summary": "Get ready for a charming hidden-object adventure in Hidden Squirrels! Explore beautifully detailed black-and-white scenes and search for adorable squirrels hiding in every corner. Look closely, zoom in on the smallest details, and uncover all the sneaky little critters waiting to be found. Every discovery brings you one step closer to transforming the entire illustration into a colorful work of art!\n\nEach environment is packed with tiny details, amusing scenes, and little stories waiting to be discovered. As you find the hidden squirrels in different areas, entire sections of the map burst into vivid color! Watch buildings, streets, and other parts of the scenery come to life as you complete each section. Keep your eyes open, because you might even spot special appearances by characters from other games by the studio!", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hidden-squirrels", "videos": [{"id": 202901, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "NwNRJy4U_xA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwNRJy4U_xA", "title": "Hidden Squirrels | Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NwNRJy4U_xA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}